From: virtudude <virtudude@protonmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] DocumentsUI: drop the cross-profile attribute

Lepton's image disables CrossProfileAppsService, and system_server
dereferences it whenever an app marked android:crossProfile comes to the
foreground, so opening the picker kills the container. The image has no
work profiles to cross.

---
diff --git a/AndroidManifest.xml b/AndroidManifest.xml
index 552d596..9bbe724 100644
--- a/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -44,8 +44,7 @@
         android:allowBackup="true"
         android:backupAgent=".prefs.BackupAgent"
         android:appCategory="productivity"
-        android:fullBackupOnly="false"
-        android:crossProfile="true">
+        android:fullBackupOnly="false">
 
         <meta-data
             android:name="com.google.android.backup.api_key"
